### [INT] DEPARTMENT OF THE INTERIOR, ENVIRONMENT, AND RELATED AGENCIES

Environmental Programs and Management is appropriated $3,114,671,000 [[num:src_int_50ecf038_8cf4_4344_8029_44323ef53133_1]] for FY2026, to remain available until September 30, 2027.

It supports environmental programs and management, including:
- necessary expenses not otherwise provided for;
- personnel and related costs and travel expenses;
- hire, maintenance, and operation of passenger motor vehicles and aircraft;
- purchase of reprints and library memberships;
- administrative costs of the brownfields program;
- implementation of a coal combustion residual permit program;
- grants, including projects, implementation, and training;
- the Energy Star Program; and
- Environmental Protection: National Priorities.

The account may also be used to provide grants to implement the Southeast New England Watershed Restoration Program.

